{"t":"Large Seashell (Quest Closed)","s":"large-seashell-quest-closed-8a66b","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Large_Seashell_Quest_Closed_ba49af.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Large Seashell (Quest Closed)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Large Seashell (Quest Closed)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Seashell_Quest_Closed_ba49af.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Living and Dead<br/>Animals</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190408204334&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Seashell_Quest_Closed_ba49af.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a large seashell.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Maybe there's something inside of it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Below <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Depending on which one you open, you will be rewarded with <a href=\"#/wiki/Some%20Broken%20Shells%20%28Item%29\">Some Broken Shells (Item)</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishbone\">Fishbone</a> and two <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a>, or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Ear\">Sea Ear</a>. It can also give you nothing or spawn a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crab\">Crab</a>.<br/>It will turn into a Large Seashell (Quest Open) upon opening.<br/>Looks the same as a Large Seashell (Closed) and a Seashell (Large).<br/>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fishbone\">Fishbone</a></li><li>Large Seashell (Closed)</li><li>Large Seashell (Quest Open)</li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Ear\">Sea Ear</a></li><li>Seashell (Large)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Some%20Broken%20Shells%20%28Item%29\">Some Broken Shells (Item)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest","quest":"Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest","step":"3-2","n":29,"title":"Procurar nas conchas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}